### division before multiplication by 100
pct=$(( done_count / total * 100 ))
>>> SC2017 1:20
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2154 1:22
>>> SC2154 1:9

### multiplication first is fine
pct=$(( done_count * 100 / total ))
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2154 1:28
>>> SC2154 1:9

### same divisor and multiplier is fine
rounded=$(( value / 10 * 10 ))
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2154 1:13
